<title>USA: CCC buys 5,080 T U.S. HRW wheat for Kenya.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 5,080 T U.S. HRW wheat for Kenya.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 5,080 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for export to Kenya. Shipment was slated for July 1-25.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the wheat was bought from Cargill Inc at $147.44 a tonne, FOB, Houston, Texas.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
